DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
43743::$$$message_0372_0000_0000$$$::"And with that,[lr]::
43744::$$$message_0372_0000_0001$$$::our heroines, Gym Shorts and Taiga, have defeated the three ogres plaguing the Emiya residence."::
43745::$$$message_0372_0001_0000$$$::"There are three Servants left."::
43746::$$$message_0372_0002_0000$$$::"To defeat Assassin, Lancer, and Berserker, Loli Gym Shorts must hurry to the peak of Ryudou Temple and take down the Young Wife."::
43747::$$$message_0372_0003_0000$$$::"Hurry, Gym Shorts. Save your friends laid low by the assassin's bullets![lr]::
43748::$$$message_0372_0003_0001$$$::There are three hours left until sunset![lr]::
43749::$$$message_0372_0003_0002$$$::[hffacechg chara=ぞうけん face=哀 layer=1 time=200]I only have three hours left to live..."::
43750::$$$message_0372_0004_0000$$$::"...Hey, Illya. There's an old guy in the woods next to us labeled 'Muttering Saint[whitestar]Arrow.' Is he a friend of yours?"[nolr][p]::
43751::$$$message_0372_0004_0001$$$::"Nope, I've never heard of someone like that in my whole life."::
43752::$$$message_0372_0004_0002$$$::"Anyway, the next temple is in sight! Don't get sloppy now, Taiga!"::
43753::$$$message_0372_0004_0003$$$::"You can count on me, Gym Shorts. However it is, I'll whack 'em to smithereens with this Tiger Bamboo Sword."::
43754::$$$message_0372_0004_0004$$$::"Fuuushshshshshsh (note: laughter).[lr]::
43755::$$$message_0372_0004_0005$$$::If push comes to shove, I'll awaken my seventh sense!"::
43756::$$$message_0372_0004_0006$$$::"Heh, that's pretty reassuring coming from an enemy![l][br][hffacechg chara=ブルマイリヤ face=喜2 layer=1 time=200][hfwww layer=1][say storage=HSTR5_BIR_0040 _name=ブルマイリヤ]Okay, let's keep up that rhythm and beat up another lovey-dovey couple!"::
43757::$$$message_0372_0005_0000$$$::"A moment, girl. And the feral beast."::
43758::$$$message_0372_0005_0001$$$::"Wh-[wait canskip=0 time=300][l][hffacechg chara=藤ねえ face=真剣 layer=1 time=200][hfchance layer=1][say storage=HSTR5_TIG_0060 _name=藤ねえ]who the heck are you!?"::
43759::$$$message_0372_0005_0002$$$::"Don't tell me..."[nolr][p]::
43760::$$$message_0372_0005_0003$$$::"Sasaki Gorillo!!!"::
43761::$$$message_0372_0005_0004$$$::"That's a Sasaki Typollo!"[nolr][p]::
43762::$$$message_0372_0005_0005$$$::"...You're sure running on full throttle today.[lr]::
43763::$$$message_0372_0005_0006$$$::Whatever. Strange one, this gate is not meant for a single woman like you to pass through."::
43764::$$$message_0372_0006_0000$$$::"If you have time for such amusements, consider making time for a marriage interview."::
43765::$$$message_0372_0006_0001$$$::"Gah, that got me right where it hurts...!"::
43766::$$$message_0372_0006_0002$$$::"That was better left unsaid! Now one of us has to die!"[nolr]::
43767::$$$message_0372_0007_0000$$$::"H-hold on, Taiga! Don't be hasty![lr]::
43768::$$$message_0372_0007_0001$$$::[nolr]Everyone knows that one of the mysterious rules in shonen manga is that whoever moves first loses!!!"::
43769::$$$message_0372_0007_0002$$$::"Souichirou... Your tea is ready."[nolr]::
43770::$$$message_0372_0008_0000$$$::"... (nods slightly)"::
43771::$$$message_0372_0008_0001$$$::"...Is it still not to your taste after all? I roasted it the way Issei showed me..."::
43772::$$$message_0372_0008_0002$$$::"...Your tea's flavor is unique to you. It is incomparable to anything else."::
43773::$$$message_0372_0008_0003$$$::"But...if I had to state my personal preference, I do enjoy this heat."::
43774::$$$message_0372_0008_0004$$$::"...!"::
43775::$$$message_0372_0008_0005$$$::"(This! This is what I've wanted! Thank you, great Buddha! I despise the gods, but I love you!)"::
43776::$$$message_0372_0008_0006$$$::"U-keh-keh-keh-keh. Then give me your offerings![lr]::
43777::$$$message_0372_0008_0007$$$::For now, I'll have you convert that happiness to Japanese yen and serve me a pork bowl with egg on top!"::
43778::$$$message_0372_0008_0008$$$::"That's so cheap!"[nolr][p]::
43779::$$$message_0372_0008_0009$$$::"I mean, what's the meaning of this!?"[nolr]::
43780::$$$message_0372_0009_0000$$$::"A-ha-ha. Sorry, Caster. I screwed up."[nolr]::
43781::$$$message_0372_0010_0000$$$::"Dammit, Sasakiiii!"[nolr]::
43782::$$$message_0372_0011_0000$$$::"Ahhh, the tea and (failed) chestnut cake, dashed! Just like my brother!"::
43783::$$$message_0372_0011_0001$$$::"..."::
43784::$$$message_0372_0011_0002$$$::"Ahh, it's all over Souichirou! I mean, Souichirou is smothered in tea and...cake...[wait time=600][wvs][skip_next_tag][br]::
43785::$$$message_0372_0011_0003$$$::...[hfsigh layer=1]oh."::
43786::$$$message_0372_0011_0004$$$::"...Why is she blushing?"::
43787::$$$message_0372_0011_0005$$$::"Mrgh. The yen exchange rate goes up again![lr]::
43788::$$$message_0372_0011_0006$$$::[se storage=se197.wav]Hold it, pointy-ears. I won't stand for a lunch that costs more than 500 yen!"::
43789::$$$message_0372_0012_0000$$$::"What is all this commotion? Well, if it isn't the Holy Grail and the useless teacher."::
43790::$$$message_0372_0013_0000$$$::"I don't remember inviting you here."::
43791::$$$message_0372_0013_0001$$$::"We invited ourselves."::
43792::$$$message_0372_0013_0002$$$::"...But anyway, [l][hfwww layer=1][say storage=HSTR5_TIG_0180 _name=藤ねえ]what are you doing, Caster?"::
43793::$$$message_0372_0014_0000$$$::"The Holy Grail War's started, you know.[lr]::
43794::$$$message_0372_0014_0001$$$::Shouldn't you be scheming and manipulating behind the scenes like you always do?"::
43795::$$$message_0372_0014_0002$$$::"It's not as if I enjoy doing that."::
43796::$$$message_0372_0014_0003$$$::"I've graduated from stealing and tricking people."::
43797::$$$message_0372_0015_0000$$$::"I've found my happiness right here. Why should I push myself?"::
43798::$$$message_0372_0015_0001$$$::"Besides, I'm not suited to the Holy Grail War. If you want this star, you can have it."::
43799::$$$message_0372_0015_0002$$$::"Huh."::
43800::$$$message_0372_0015_0003$$$::"...What is it, Assassin? I do not appreciate such a face."::
43801::$$$message_0372_0015_0004$$$::"Oh, I just found your anguish so pitiable I couldn't help but smile."::
43802::$$$message_0372_0015_0005$$$::"A personality cultivated over many years can be quite stubborn. The ego is the enemy of eternity, after all."::
43803::$$$message_0372_0016_0000$$$::"...Haha, it isn't easy to change one's personality after 2X years."::
43804::$$$message_0372_0017_0000$$$::"Huh? [l][hfchance layer=1][say storage=HSTR5_TIG_0230 _name=藤ねえ]No way! Caster, you're 2X years old!? You're older than Mr. Kuzuki!?"[nolr]::
43805::$$$message_0372_0018_0000$$$::"AAAAAAH!"[rf]::
43806::$$$message_0372_0019_0000$$$::"[large]Sasaki[rf], [large]stop [rf]talking about my [large]age[rf]!!!"::
43807::$$$message_0372_0019_0001$$$::"Hahaha. My apologies. It was a slip of the tongue."[nolr]::
43808::$$$message_0372_0020_0000$$$::"Still, don't let that dampen your spirits, Caster. [nolr]Souichirou isn't concerned about your age. What's wrong with being thought of as a wife of ripe age?"[p]::
43809::$$$message_0372_0020_0001$$$::"Well said, Sasaki![lr]::
43810::$$$message_0372_0020_0002$$$::[hfwww layer=1]That's right. Age difference doesn't matter, Caster!"::
43811::$$$message_0372_0020_0003$$$::"Mr. Kuzuki is surrounded by young girls every day, so you've got nothing to worry about! Show them how an older woman fights!"::
43812::$$$message_0372_0020_0004$$$::"I guess you can't be a heroine at age 2X, though!"::
43813::$$$message_0372_0020_0005$$$::"Indeed. Just use your vaunted magecraft to de-age yourself. I'm sure a witch like you has some cosmetic tricks to her name."::
43814::$$$message_0372_0020_0006$$$::"Heh. [hfquake layer=message0 wait=0 hmax=0 vmax=3]Hehehehehe."::
43815::$$$message_0372_0021_0000$$$::"I've decided that I'm going to fight in this Holy Grail War."::
43816::$$$message_0372_0021_0001$$$::"Huh? [l][hfwww layer=1][say storage=HSTR5_TIG_0310 _name=藤ねえ]Um, what's up with this weird tension? It was all heartwarming, and now I'm just getting static."::
43817::$$$message_0372_0021_0002$$$::"I don't particularly have a wish, but I suddenly want the Holy Grail."::
43818::$$$message_0372_0022_0000$$$::"I also have an urge to blast you all back to the Einzbern Forest."::
43819::$$$message_0372_0022_0001$$$::"Souichirou, please go rest in the main temple. I won't cause any trouble for you."::
43820::$$$message_0372_0022_0002$$$::"...No, if I'm going to rest, then it should be with you. I know what my role is in the Holy Grail War."::
43821::$$$message_0372_0022_0003$$$::"Let's do this, Caster. I have to at least repay you for the tea and snacks."::
43822::$$$message_0372_0022_0004$$$::"Souichirou..."::
43823::$$$message_0372_0022_0005$$$::"Heh, hehe, [wm][l][hfwww layer=0][say storage=HSTR5_CAS_0280 _name=キャスター]hehehehehehehehe![lr]::
43824::$$$message_0372_0022_0006$$$::Are you ready for this, you dunce duo!? Assassin, take care of them!"::
43825::$$$message_0372_0022_0007$$$::"There it is. Sorry, tiger girl. I held back earlier, but I'm going to give it an earnest effort this time."::
43826::$$$message_0372_0022_0008$$$::"Now that Caster's back, there are more battles in store after this."::
43827::$$$message_0372_0022_0009$$$::"...I see, you used us.[lr]::
43828::$$$message_0372_0022_0010$$$::It's three on two... What should we do, Taiga? We're at a disadvantage. We could fall back and re[line len=2]"::
43829::$$$message_0372_0022_0011$$$::"No need for that, Illya. I won't lose no matter how many we're fighting, and I won't let them hurt you, either."::
43830::$$$message_0372_0022_0012$$$::"Just trust the Servant you chose, Master."::
43831::$$$message_0372_0022_0013$$$::"Taiga... [l][hfchance layer=1][say storage=HSTR5_BIR_0130 _name=ブルマイリヤ]Oh no, that actually made me tear up a little."::
43833::$$$message_0372_0022_0015$$$::"Well, it sounds like the perfect handicap for me! Let's do this, Caster! I'll show you how much difference X years can make...!"::
43834::$$$message_0372_0022_0016$$$::"ARRRRRRGH![lr]::
43835::$$$message_0372_0022_0017$$$::What does my age have to do with it!?"[nolr][p]::

